            <ul>{features.filter((f) => f[1] === "next").map((f) => <li>{f[0]}</li>)}</ul>
            <p class="fl-build-note">Built from the start to grow into firm accounts and white-label versions for advisory firms.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ol class="fl-road">
          <li><span>1</span><strong>Foundation</strong><small>Accounts, six dimensions, the daily flow, mobile screens</small></li>
          <li><span>2</span><strong>Working journey</strong><small>Clarity Wheel, report, suggested action, reminders, consent</small></li>
          <li><span>3</span><strong>Pilot</strong><small>10 advisors and consenting founders</small></li>
          <li><span>4</span><strong>Scale</strong><small>Firm accounts, subscriptions, white-label options</small></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== CTA ===== -->
    <section class="fl-band fl-band--last" aria-labelledby="fl-cta">
      <div class="fl-wrap">
        <div class="fl-cta">
          <div>
            <p class="fl-eyebrow">The pilot</p>
            <h2 id="fl-cta">Make the first seven days <em>feel remarkable.</em></h2>
            <p>We are looking for a small group of exit planners, CEPAs and succession advisors to shape foundr.land with us. Interested, or want to hear when it opens?</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fl-ctas">
            <a class="fl-btn" href="/contact">Join the advisor pilot</a>
            <a class="fl-btn fl-btn--ghost" href="/newsletter">Follow along</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="fl-concept fl-concept--end">foundr.land is a product concept by DoGood Agency and is not yet built. Everything shown is illustrative.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-fl-anim]").forEach((el) => {
    if (!("IntersectionObserver" in window) || window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches) return;
    el.classList.add("fl-will");
    const io = new IntersectionObserver(([e]) => {
      if (!e?.isIntersecting) return;
      el.classList.add("fl-in");
      io.disconnect();
    }, { threshold: 0.2 });
    io.observe(el);
  });
</script>

